  "solution": "Logic : (Square of 1st number) × 2 = 2nd number\n\nGiven :\n\n__\n \n• 5 ∶ 50\n\n(5)² × 2 = 50\n\n**25 × 2**__ = 50\n\n50 = 50 (LHS = RHS)\n\n__\n \n• 12 ∶ 288\n\n(12)² × 2 = 288\n\n**144 × 2**__ = 288\n\n288 = 288 (LHS = RHS)\n\nSo,\n\n__\n \n• Option - (1) : 4 ∶ 36\n\n(4)² × 2 = 36\n\n**16 **____**× 2**__ = 36\n\n32 ≠ 36 (LHS ≠ RHS)\n\n__\n \n• Option - (2) : 8 ∶ 128\n\n(8)² × 2 = 128\n\n**64 **____**× 2**__ = 128\n\n128 = 128 (LHS = RHS)\n\n__\n \n• Option - (3) : 9 ∶ 161\n\n(9)² × 2 = 161\n\n**81 × **____**2**__ = 161\n\n162 ≠ 161 (LHS ≠ RHS)\n\n__\n\n \n• Option - (4) : 6 ∶ 70\n\n(6)² × 2 = 70\n\n**36 × **____**2**__ = 70\n\n72 ≠ 70 (LHS ≠ RHS)\n\nHence, \"Option - (2)\" is the correct answer.\n\n9f:T1505,",
